id: og_tunnel
name: Wind Tunnel
description: Wind Tunnel. A closed circuit with no dead ends anywhere in it, so the only way to break contact is to be faster than whoever is following you round. Built as a closed-circuit wind tunnel; the fan was run down and the test section left open at both ends.

grid: 1.7
wall_thickness: 0.3

